{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10114170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10114170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011416003:":{"text":"누구야?!","source_cn":"谁？！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7411F1AF89AABF10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011416001:":{"text":"세월은 메말라 가고, 초목은 시드는구나.","source_cn":"岁月苍凉，草木褪零。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD77F555355936E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011416002:":{"text":"아주 훌륭해...","source_cn":"很好……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32961F9AEBE25E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011416004:":{"text":"후훗.","source_cn":"呵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5829385CBCF899C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011417001:1":{"text":"저... 저 여자! 검은 원피스에 창백한 얼굴...!","source_cn":"那……那个女人！黑色长裙，苍白的脸……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0677941DC4ED63B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011417002:1":{"text":"저 여자가 로드 프란츠와 손 잡았던 <style=\"highlight\">검은 옷의 여인</style>이야?!","source_cn":"她就是和弗朗茨合作的<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA29E38025DD3EC23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011417003:1":{"text":"부패의 원흉을 찾았어! 저 여자가 방금 마법을 이용해 땅거미 숲에 부패를 퍼뜨리고 있었다고!","source_cn":"终于被我们找到罪魁祸首了！就是她在用刚才的法术，四处在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD484ED4D2CE86A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011417004:1":{"text":"숲을 부패시킨 사람이 정말로 레오프론 제국 사람이란 말이야?...","source_cn":"腐化丛林的，真的是耀光帝国的人吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FDD80EA7206C002","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1011417005:1":{"text":"이미르 현자의 주장이 옳았다니...?","source_cn":"伊米尔贤者的主张，竟然是对的……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB1E781FD97E289","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011417006:0":{"text":"아니야, 뭔가 잘못된 거 같아.","source_cn":"不，好像有些不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x130865943A155CB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1011417006":{"text":"아니야, 뭔가 잘못된 거 같아.","source_cn":"不，好像有些不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x130865943A155CB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1011417007:1":{"text":"아! 생각났어욥!","source_cn":"啊！我想起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB238440684E8F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011417008:1":{"text":"창백한 피부에 부패한 냄새, 그리고 뛰지 않는 심장...","source_cn":"灰白的皮肤，腐朽的气息，无法跳动的心脏，她是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CB3C98C794DF17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1011417008":{"text":"창백한 피부에 부패한 냄새, 그리고 뛰지 않는 심장...","source_cn":"灰白的皮肤，腐朽的气息，无法跳动的心脏，她是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CB3C98C794DF17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011417009:1":{"text":"그레이브본?!","source_cn":"亡灵？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50BBB473D99E2182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011417010:0":{"text":"예전에 책에서 읽은 적 있어요. 망령이 모여있는 나라, <style=\"highlight\">반티스 제국</style>, 그리고 영면에 들지 못한 사람들에 관한 내용이었는데...","source_cn":"我曾经在书上读到过，亡者群集的国度，<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52314EB5CFE3823E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011417011:0":{"text":"하지만 그레이브본이 왜 갑자기 땅거미 숲에 온 거죠? 와일더스 멤버와 그들은 전혀 교류가 없었어요. 그래서 원한 같은 것도 당연히 없을 텐데요.","source_cn":"但，亡灵怎么会突然来到薄暮丛林呢？这里的绿裔成员和他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD579D76B561EF03D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011417012:1":{"text":"부패가 외부의 마법으로 만들어진 거였군요. 검과 불로는 제거할 수 없었던 이유를 이제 알겠어요...","source_cn":"腐化原来是由外来魔法造就的，怪不得凭剑刃和火焰，都无法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2493E3BA5096667","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1011417013:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 그레이브본 여인이 마법으로 부패시킨 뿌리의 상태를 알고 싶어요. 서머너에게 부탁해도 될까요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB98B9811CC280348","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 그레이브본 여인이 마법으로 부패시킨 뿌리의 상태를 알고 싶어요. 서머너에게 부탁해도 될까요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 그레이브본 여인이 마법으로 부패시킨 뿌리의 상태를 알고 싶어요. 서머너에게 부탁해도 될까요?","variant_male_record_index":"108481","variant_female_record_index":"108482","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1011417014:1":{"text":"그렇다면 치피에게 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"好嘞，就交给满满吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5C1388F6F3926C7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇다면 치피에게 맡겨주세요!","female":"그렇다면 치피에게 맡겨주세